      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……老实说，我们正因为人手不足而感到为难。\n那就拜托你们了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a2646910cd86b1755d4be1634eea6d53828cea33cb66dba3e04519faec4a7e0",
